menu "CPE SMS Configuration"

    config CPE_SMS_ENABLE
        bool "Enable SMS over the modem AT interface"
        default n
        help
            Adds a management-console page to list/send/delete SMS messages
            using the modem AT interface. Requires AT telemetry (CPE_AT_ENABLE)
            and a modem that exposes a usable AT port and supports PDU-mode
            reception (AT+CMGF=0, AT+CMGL=4) plus text-mode sending
            (AT+CMGF=1, AT+CMGS). Capability is probed at runtime; on a modem
            without SMS support the page reports "unsupported" and the 4G data
            path is unaffected. Sending is rate limited and requires a valid
            admin session. Disabled by default.

endmenu
